-- Sprint F-3: seed book_series junction (234 links)
-- entry_id/name joins resolve UUIDs at runtime (no hardcoded ids, B-3c doctrine).
-- Two CSV series spelling-variants map onto canonical ids (see F-2): the alias
-- rows are listed here under their canonical name ('The Twice-Dead King','Jarnhamar').
-- sort_position derived from series_order: omnibus=-100, short-prequel=-1,
-- '#n'/'n'=n, short=9000, standalone=9999, empty=NULL. books.sort_order is the
-- runtime tiebreaker for NULL/equal positions (e.g. two omnibus volumes in one
-- series, or the also_in cross-phase 'Apocalypse' pair, both legitimately #5).
-- Idempotent via ON CONFLICT (book_id, series_id) DO NOTHING.

